- O zi bună, dle profesor.

00:38:24.100 --> 00:38:25.269
Hachi!

00:38:26.605 --> 00:38:30.947
Poftim! Să nu-i spui lui Milton.

00:39:05.349 --> 00:39:07.061
Hachi!

00:39:12.447 --> 00:39:14.827
Hai acasă!

00:39:28.270 --> 00:39:30.190
Hachi!

00:39:37.497 --> 00:39:39.877
Mai trebuie şampanie!

00:40:35.488 --> 00:40:36.991
Hachi!

00:40:45.884 --> 00:40:47.596
