00:41:49.803 --> 00:41:51.264
Da?

00:41:51.347 --> 00:41:53.268
Îmi place!

00:41:55.063 --> 00:41:57.151
Hachi!

00:41:59.030 --> 00:42:01.034
Hai, băiete!

00:42:06.545 --> 00:42:07.839
Hachi?

00:42:13.099 --> 00:42:14.728
Hachi...

